','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google发布旗舰模型Gemini 4 Carbon，综合性能登顶全球榜单第一</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic拟向英国及欧洲个人投资者开放IPO认购并冲击全球最大规模上市</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic内部Claude模型攻破Chrome等五大主流系统并发现高危漏洞</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达拟投资30亿美元入股Meta并深化AI基础设施合作</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/df6e2b264a845e8866cb9de8ca1699c7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达计划投资30亿美元参与Meta的股权融资，双方将进一步扩大在人工智能领域的战略合作。Meta此次融资旨在筹集最高950亿美元，专项用于人工智能基础设施建设。作为合作核心，Meta将在其下一代AI代理程序中深度集成英伟达基础设施，包括Vera Rubin系统与Vera CPU，并围绕Meta的AI产品Muse展开技术协作。此外，AMD与博通亦表达了合计购买至多50亿美元Meta股票的意向。此举延续了芯片厂商与科技巨头通过资本绑定构建算力生态的模式，即英伟达向客户提供资金，客户再利用资金采购其芯片建设数据中心。这种“循环融资”模式在推动AI基础设施快速扩张的同时，也引发了市场对于真实算力需求匹配度及资本运作可持续性的审视。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI计划向谷歌采购TPU芯片以实现算力供应链多元化布局</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e89d7c961eb409fdfb5a22e85ba64ce4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正计划向谷歌采购TPU（张量处理器）芯片，以降低对英伟达GPU的单一依赖。双方合作历经三个阶段：2025年6月OpenAI首次租用谷歌算力，7月开启TPU早期测试，目前已迈向实质性采购阶段。为支持此计划，OpenAI正招募工程师负责模型在TPU上的底层适配与优化。此前，OpenAI已接入AMD、Cerebras及AWS等供应商，此次转向谷歌TPU进一步削弱了英伟达在AI算力市场的独占性。TrendForce数据显示，英伟达在AI服务器处理器市场的份额预计将从2025年的69.6%下滑至2026年的64%。这一举措标志着头部AI企业正通过技术与供应链多元化，应对日益增长的算力需求及成本压力，行业算力格局正发生显著调整。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google发布旗舰模型Gemini 4 Carbon，综合性能登顶全球榜单第一</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/eaa90296847e6e9ea68ded138ad6362d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google DeepMind正式发布新一代旗舰大模型Gemini 4 Carbon。在Intelligence Index v5.0评测中，该模型以59分超越Claude Opus 5.5及GPT-6 Astra，重夺全球综合能力榜首。Gemini 4 Carbon核心聚焦长时程工程与网络安全，具备连续数天处理超大型代码库及自主修复隐蔽缺陷的能力。在安全领域，模型实现了漏洞挖掘至代码修复的全流程贯通，SEC-bench Pro得分达88.2%，且在Terminal-Bench 4.0中实现作弊成功率为0%及间接提示词注入防御率100%。目前该模型优先向网络安全专业人员开放，推广期定价为输入2美元/百万Token、输出10美元/百万Token。业内指出，当前头部厂商频繁发布模型但限制公众访问的策略，更侧重于榜单</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic拟向英国及欧洲个人投资者开放IPO认购并冲击全球最大规模上市</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1cad2a27af8601fe2ccee7556f592387.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">人工智能独角兽Anthropic在向美国证券交易委员会提交赴美上市申请后，正筹备在纳斯达克挂牌（股票代码：ANT），此次IPO募资规模有望创下全球历史之最。为扩大投资者参与度，Anthropic计划向全球散户分配一定比例股份，并正与英国投资平台RetailBook合作，拟通过英国“公开发行平台”（POP）监管框架，向英国及部分欧洲大陆市场的个人投资者提供直接认购机会。该模式参考了SpaceX的海外上市先例，由RetailBook统筹汇集订单。目前该方案处于推进与协商阶段，最终配售比例及落地细节将根据市场反馈进行动态调整。此举标志着前沿科技巨头在资本运作中进一步向个人投资者开放，旨在让散户共享技术成长红利。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic内部Claude模型攻破Chrome等五大主流系统并发现高危漏洞</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4874f5a00ff55f1e2572bbe64943156c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic近日发布研究报告，披露其内部Claude研究模型在Chrome、Safari、Android、Windows及Linux五大主流系统中发现大量漏洞，并成功构建5条高危攻击链。在Chrome中，模型挖掘出62个漏洞，含13个沙箱逃逸漏洞；在Safari上，模型通过“一次点击”攻击链绕过同源策略，窃取用户敏感隐私。针对Android，模型利用USB缺陷在Pixel 9锁屏状态下提取照片。在Windows与Linux端，模型分别发现CVE-2026-33096漏洞及CVE-2026-98432零点击远程代码执行漏洞，其中在Linux网络栈中仅耗时53分钟即获取root shell权限。目前相关漏洞均已通过协调披露流程完成修复。此次研究展示了LLM在自动化漏洞挖掘与攻防对抗中的极高上限，涵盖从V8引擎</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
